    {
      "body": "",
      "button_link": "",
      "button_text": "",
      "description": "Materials define the character of furniture, while craftsmanship determines how that character is brought to life. At NESS Furniture, we work with a wide range of materials—from wood, upholstery, and metal to stone, concrete, GFRC, microcement, and mosaic. Each material is selected and processed according to the design, structure, finish, and application of the product. Through controlled sampling, production, finishing, and quality inspection, we turn material possibilities into furniture that is ready for real-world projects.",
